{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(float)} |= v_2.len = shape(v_1, 0) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : v_2[i] ≠ 0
>>
Rule 3 (tensor rank must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (List of floats representing input parameters for a model must have a length greater than zero)
{v_1 : list(float)} |= v_1.len > 0
>>
Rule 6 (list of ints should be non-empty)
{v_1 : list(int)} |= v_1.len > 0
>>
